            "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:05:15.111943+00:00",
            "notes": "[So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) leaves a 3 second AoE burn after your [Lille F\u00e6lde](item_d92c59ae-b2f5-48e5-9f60-66144441eee8) shots as well as your regular bola from ult. It does quite a bit of damage, and the lingering dps can often catch people off guard. Always try to land Lille shots direct, but you can now also throw them in chokes for good pressure if their team is stacked.\n\nWe should have enough money for both [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) and [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b), Giving us a rather strong power spike. Sell Armored vest if you don't have enough. Always make sure that superflexor is stacked before you use Lille or bola\n\n[Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) can be taken over exaust ports, though it is very greedy and generally not recommended.",
