            "notes": "[Redux](item_e27dc8d9-4fa9-4e55-bf9a-7a4b3532a0d8) is taken for the cooldown reduction for more Lille shots.\n\nThis is where we start to have quite a lot more options for what we want to take. IMO, the best feeling options here are either [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) or [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). If you are rich, snag a [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) in place of your armored vest.\n\n Iris can deal with squishies a bit better, and Tommygun can melt tanks much easier. Buy according to their weakness.",
