            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:05:15.482216+00:00",
            "notes": "Complete our core trio with the one you didn't take last round. Swap [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) for [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) now that our base health is a bit higher.\n\nAt this point, you can start to flex in any of the epic ability options as you see fit for the game state you are in. If you can afford one of these by not buying Multi-tool, do so.\n\n[Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) if you want more weapon damage.\n\n[Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) or [Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d) to keep them in your Lille/bola burns for longer. Can really help with securing kills. \n\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you are taking too much damage.\n\n[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) can be really good if their team comp cant deal with your big bola at all, as it will give you a ton of potential ult nukes every round. Avoid it if they have any way to eat or deflect, as the other options are generally more useful. Can be BiS depending on their comp, though.",
